# Neutralize the Guards ({2}{B}) at Bot2: each creature Bot2 controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn, so its Memnite (1/1) dies and
# its Ornithopter (0/2) becomes -1/1 and survives, while Bot1's own Memnite is untouched (CR 611.2c). Then Bot1 surveils 2
# (CR 701.25): Forest and Island are the top two; Island goes back on top and Forest to the graveyard. The shrink ends at the
# cleanup step (CR 514.2): the Ornithopter is 0/2 again on turn 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Neutralize the Guards
Swamp
Swamp
Mountain
Forest
Island
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Neutralize the Guards.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Island | Forest)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard = Neutralize the Guards; Forest
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Library = Island; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
